{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_9358EED0","title":"Bring Banor on board","entry":"Dlg_9358EED0::entry","exit":"Dlg_9358EED0::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_A3EA5AD8","articyId":"72057645577628878","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"What do you need boss?","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you need boss?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":525.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30406","byteOffset":19383976,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_12AA717A","articyId":"72057645577629045","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"I guessed you'd come talk to me about this at some point.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I guessed you'd come talk to me about this at some point.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42301","byteOffset":30331696,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_887B3EA9","articyId":"72057645577629061","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"An old friend said you'd be a big deal in Nivalis. You'd end up owning much more than a noodle stand, and you'd need help.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"An old friend said you'd be a big deal in Nivalis. You'd end up owning much more than a noodle stand, and you'd need help.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2025.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42609","byteOffset":30447920,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_5E948F32","articyId":"72057645577629075","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"In a manner of speaking. Sometimes it's like I can think like Old Thad. Like I have his voice in my head. And he told me this would happen.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In a manner of speaking. Sometimes it's like I can think like Old Thad. Like I have his voice in my head. And he told me this would happen.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2625.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29473","byteOffset":19028712,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_98726327","articyId":"72057645577629095","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Keep an eye on every business you run. And you only got two, boss.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Keep an eye on every business you run. And you only got two, boss.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3225.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47737","byteOffset":32395128,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_C6BFA35E","articyId":"72057645577629111","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Promised the Old Man I would. Not the one in my head, the real one. I got you, boss.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Promised the Old Man I would. Not the one in my head, the real one. I got you, boss.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3825.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47926","byteOffset":32467216,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_555D23B4","articyId":"72057645577629125","typ